groovebox-scene 1
# Recording through the panel only. Syn 1 on pad 1 of T4, the track the factory project leaves
# empty: T4, then MENU + step 3, OK, down twice and OK in the sound picker. A tap of PADS/KEYS then
# makes the pads keys: pads 1, 5 and 8 play C4, E4 and G4 of Syn 1.
input 1600 press t4
input 2400 release t4
input 3200 press menu
input 4800 press step-3
input 6400 release step-3
input 8000 release menu
input 9600 press ok
input 11200 release ok
input 12800 press down
input 14400 release down
input 16000 press down
input 17600 release down
input 19200 press ok
input 20800 release ok
input 22400 press pads-keys
input 24000 release pads-keys
# MENU + step 9 shows PATTERN, PAGE + step 2 its Bars page and push 1 the Length picker on 1 bar;
# down once onto 2 bars and OK choose it. MENU + step 1 shows STEP.
input 25600 press menu
input 27200 press step-9
input 28800 release step-9
input 30400 release menu
input 32000 press page
input 33600 press step-2
input 35200 release step-2
input 36800 release page
input 38400 press push-1
input 40000 release push-1
input 41600 press down
input 43200 release down
input 44800 press ok
input 46400 release ok
input 48000 press menu
input 49600 press step-1
input 51200 release step-1
input 52800 release menu
# REC while stopped arms it: REC blinks with the beat and the header's record dot is dim.
# Frame: STEP armed, the dim dot.
input 57600 press rec
input 59200 release rec
frame 64000
# PLAY counts in one bar, 96,000 samples at 120 BPM, and the pattern starts at 198,400. The music
# line, the step buttons and the screen stand on bar 1 and the record dot stays dim.
# Frame: STEP during the count-in, halfway, standing on bar 1.
input 102400 press play
input 104000 release play
frame 150400
# A hit of C4 2,000 samples before the first beat is snapped onto it, as Quantize is on.
input 196400 pad-hit 0 100
input 207200 pad-release 0
# Bar 1: E4 a little early on beat 2 and G4 a little late on beat 3, each snapped onto its beat.
input 220900 pad-hit 4 90
input 228000 pad-release 4
input 247700 pad-hit 7 110
input 254000 pad-release 7
# Bar 2: C4 a little early on beat 1, snapped onto it, and E4 a little late on beat 2.
input 293400 pad-hit 0 120
input 300000 pad-release 0
input 319200 pad-hit 4 70
input 324000 pad-release 4
# REC has been steady and the dot red since the first beat, and the music line moves.
# Frame: STEP while recording, the red dot, the notes of bar 2 so far (step-playing.png).
frame 345600
# G4 a little early on beat 4 is held over the loop point at 390,400, and E4 is hit 1,500 samples
# before the loop restarts and snapped onto the first beat of the next pass. Their releases are in
# the second pass and they go in then.
input 366000 pad-hit 7 100
input 388900 pad-hit 4 110
input 394000 pad-release 4
input 414400 pad-release 7
# REC off in bar 2 of the second pass drops out: the hit of C4 plays and is not recorded. REC on
# again drops back in.
input 495000 press rec
input 496600 release rec
input 504000 pad-hit 0 100
input 508000 pad-release 0
input 514000 press rec
input 515600 release rec
# A second pass overdubs: G4 a little early on beat 4 replaces the held G4 of the first pass, and
# not a second one goes in.
input 557600 pad-hit 7 100
input 563000 pad-release 7
# C4 is held when STOP comes at 576,000: the note ends there, 480 ticks long, and its release adds
# nothing. STOP leaves the cursor on bar 2.
# Frame: STEP after a take, the notes after STOP.
input 570000 pad-hit 0 90
input 576000 press stop
input 577600 release stop
input 578400 pad-release 0
frame 579200
end 588800
